# Combine positive and negative

variable C1${dir} equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C14 equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C14 equal 0.5*(-47361.5933493205+${C1pos})
variable C14 equal 0.5*(-47361.5933493205+47361.6345395478)
variable C2${dir} equal 0.5*(${C2neg}+${C2pos})
variable C24 equal 0.5*(${C2neg}+${C2pos})
variable C24 equal 0.5*(-50013.1946331956+${C2pos})
variable C24 equal 0.5*(-50013.1946331956+50013.126775979)
